    "en": "A preprint argues that a gatekeeper using finite, machine-checkable evidence cannot classify every program against certain safety rules. The result depends on the paper’s stated model.",
    "zh": "一篇预印本指出，在论文设定的模型中，依靠有限且可由机器核验的证据，门控程序无法依据某些安全规则判定所有程序。"
  },
